flowchart TD
  Host[CLI / SDK / Node / MCP] --> Policy[Workspace policy + fresh source]
  Policy --> Index[Index + context selection]
  Index --> Runtime[Agent and execution loop]
  Runtime <--> State[Private SQLite state]
  Runtime <--> Provider[Optional provider]
  Runtime --> Proposal[Reviewable proposal]
  Proposal --> Human[Human exact approval]
  Human --> Writer[Guarded writer + recovery]
  Human --> Runner[Approved command Runner]
  Runner --> Receipt[Verification receipt]
  Receipt --> State
